%% DPPL: interaksi teknis berdasarkan skenario SKPL
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor OperationsAdmin as Workshop Operations Administrator
    participant UI as Browser UI
    participant Service as BookingService
    participant Records as BookingRepository
    participant Dep as SlotPolicy
    OperationsAdmin->>UI: Review the booking request and workshop capacity
    UI->>Service: Submit booking confirmation request
    Service->>Records: Check the selected slot and branch capacity
    Records-->>Service: Return current records and validation result
    Service->>Service: Validate booking pending dan kapasitas cukup
    alt Valid
        Service->>Dep: reserveSlot(workshop, time)
        Dep-->>Service: Result
        Service->>Records: Confirm or reject the booking
        Records-->>Service: Confirm the saved or calculated result
        Service-->>UI: Reserve the slot and notify Customer
        UI-->>OperationsAdmin: Display the result and next step
    else Request needs correction or review
        Service-->>UI: Record a reason when the booking is rejected
        UI-->>OperationsAdmin: Display the reason and required action
    end
